''[[Vera (TV series)|Vera]]'' is a [[Television in the United Kingdom|British]] [[crime drama]] series based on the Vera Stanhope series of novels written by crime writer [[Ann Cleeves]]. It was first broadcast on [[ITV (TV network)|ITV]] on 1 May 2011.

{{Aired episodes|2011|5|1|2025|1|2|showpage=Vera (TV series)|finished=all|seasons=14|uk=y}}<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/drama/vera-season-13-release-date/|title=Vera season 13:Release date, cast and latest news|work=[[Radio Times]]|date=27 December 2023|access-date=21 January 2024}}</ref> Following the conclusion of the series, a special documentary was broadcast on 3 January 2025.

